    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:kaddish/shalem">
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:kaddish/chatzi"/>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kaddish/shalem/104"/>May there be acceptance of the prayers and supplications of the entire House of Israel before their Father in heaven. And say, Amein.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kaddish/shalem/105"/>May there be abundant peace from heaven and life for us and for all Israel, —and say Amein.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kaddish/shalem/106"/>He Who makes peace (<tei:hi rend="italic">Ten Days of Penitence:</tei:hi> the peace) in His high heavens may He, make peace for us and for all Israel, and say, Amen.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
